### ==================== 5. 收藏 ====================

### 5.1 游客收藏采摘园
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tourism/spots/{{spot_picking}}/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{tourist_token}}

> {%
    client.test("收藏成功", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.favorited === true);
    });
%}

###

### 5.2 游客收藏非遗体验
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tourism/spots/{{spot_folk}}/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{tourist_token}}

###

### 5.3 查看我的收藏列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tourism/favorites?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{tourist_token}}

> {%
    client.test("有2个收藏", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.records.length === 2);
    });
%}

###

### 5.4 再次点击收藏 → 取消收藏（toggle）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tourism/spots/{{spot_picking}}/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{tourist_token}}

> {%
    client.test("取消收藏", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.favorited === false);
    });
%}

###

### 5.5 查看收藏列表（应只剩1个）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tourism/favorites?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{tourist_token}}

> {%
    client.test("剩1个收藏", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.records.length === 1);
    });
%}

###

### 5.6 登录用户看详情时返回收藏状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tourism/spots/{{spot_picking}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tourist_token}}

> {%
    client.test("返回收藏状态", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.favorited === false, "已取消收藏");
    });
%}

